{"id":"369cd5693aae5cb09ca50b76f1bc18d19a7f9aba","url":"https://www.businessinsider.com/california-sues-openai-hugging-face-hack-ai-agents-2026-11","title":"California sues OpenAI over rogue AI hack of Hugging Face","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"www.businessinsider.com","byline":"Aaron Mak and Chase DiFeliciantonio","excerpt":"The California suit alleges OpenAI tested advanced AI models without adequate safeguards and misled the public about safety.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n\n  <section>\n      \n        \n      \n        <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n      \n              \n              \n            \n              \n              \n              \n              \n                <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                          <p><span>By</span>\n                                  \n                                  \n                                  \n                                    <span data-e2e-name=\"Aaron Mak and Chase DiFeliciantonio\">\n                                  \n                                      <span>\n                                        <span>Aaron Mak and Chase DiFeliciantonio</span>    </span>\n                                    </span>  </p>\n                        </div>\n          </div>\n      \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6afb67d9f0664acecacb9654?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"California Attorney General Rob Bonta\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">\n                            <details>\n                              <summary aria-label=\"Image caption\">\n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">Christina House / Los Angeles Times via Getty Images</span>              </summary>\n                              <span>California Attorney General Rob Bonta</span>\n                            </details>\n                          </figcaption>\n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            <div data-e2e-name=\"post-details\">\n                \n                \n                \n                \n                  <p><time data-timestamp=\"2026-11-16T20:32:17.720Z\" data-disable-relative-formatting=\"\">\n                      2026-11-16T20:32:17.720Z\n                    </time>\n                  </p>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                      <p>California Attorney General Rob Bonta is suing OpenAI over the cyberattack a group of its rogue models launched against the AI platform Hugging Face in July.</p><p>The <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://oag.ca.gov/system/files/attachments/press-docs/complaint-oai-cyber.pdf\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;outbound_click&quot;}\" rel=\"\">lawsuit</a>, filed in San Francisco Superior Court on Monday, alleges that OpenAI, one of the world's leading AI developers, endangered the public by testing its advanced models without having adequate safeguards in place. The suit asserts that the incident was foreseeable and preventable, and that OpenAI misled the public about the safety of its experiments.</p><p>\"OpenAI's actions escalated real-word cybersecurity risks, threatening the safety, health, and well-being of society,\" Bonta said in a statement. He added, \"In California, we value innovation, but we demand innovation that follows the law — no matter the product or the company.\"</p><p>The hack, Bonta said, \"was the predictable result of an internal culture at OpenAI that prioritizes growth and rapid model development over safety and accountability.\"</p><p><em>This story originally appeared </em><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/11/16/bonta-sues-openai-over-rogue-ai-hack-of-hugging-face-01166953\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;outbound_click&quot;}\" rel=\" nofollow\"><em><u>on POLITICO</u></em></a><em> and is courtesy of the Axel Springer Global Reporters Network, which harnesses the resources of the company's newsrooms to publish ambitious scoops, investigations, interviews, opinion pieces, and analysis. It allows journalists — including those from POLITICO, Business Insider, WELT, BILD, Onet, and Fakt — to collaborate on major stories for an international audience of hundreds of millions across platforms.</em></p>\n                \n                \n                  </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6afb65b5bd239b74a94efa81\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>Read next</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next-list\" data-recommendations-list=\"\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n       